# FreeCAD
# website: https://www.freecad.org
# docs: https://wiki.freecad.org
# description: FreeCAD open-source parametric 3D CAD modeler lock files, incremental backups, and temporary files.

# Lock files
*.FC.lock
.*.FC.lock

# Auto-save and incremental backups
*.FCBak
*.FCStd[0-9]*
*.fcstd[0-9]*

# Temporary and backup files
*.bak
*.tmp